<%# Active contract (portal mode): the header tag of the signed-in user's active instance (src/range/panel.ts myLabChip). It refreshes itself every 30 s with htmx and links the lab's page. Every value goes through the escaped output tag. Never put an EJS tag inside an EJS comment: it breaks parsing. -%>
<a class="my-lab" href="<%= myLab.href %>" data-testid="my-lab" data-state="<%= myLab.state %>" hx-get="/my-lab/chip" hx-trigger="every 30s" hx-swap="outerHTML"><span class="my-lab-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="my-lab-label"><%= myLab.label %></span><span class="my-lab-meta"><%= myLab.text %></span></a>
